<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Code Solutions | Email Recovery</title>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="entire-contents">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Email Recovery</h1>
      <br>
      <h3>Hi, <%= UserName %>. Thank you for joining us.</h3>
    </div>  

    <div class="body">
      <p>We've received your request to reset your password. To proceed, please copy this code below:</p>
      <br>
      <h2>Code: <%= Code %></h2>
      <br>
      <p>You can now click on this link to continue ...</p>
      <a href="http://4200/smth">Reset Password</a>
      <br><br>
      <p>If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your account remains secure.</p>
      <br>
      <p>Regards,</p>
      <p>Code Solutions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>